   11                  *ASCII CHARACTER DEFINITIONS
   12                  *
   13      000D        CR     EQU    $0D              ASCII CARRIAGE RETURN <CR>
   14      000A        LF     EQU    $0A              ASCII LINE FEED <LF>
   15      0010        DLE    EQU    $10              ASCII DLE
   16      0020        SPC    EQU    $20              ASCII SPACE
   17      001B        ESC    EQU    $1B              ASCII ESCAPE
   18      001A        ASUB   EQU    $1A              ASCII SUBSTITUTE CHAR
   19      0012        DC2    EQU    $12              ASCII DEVICE CONTROL #2
   20      0014        DC4    EQU    $14              ASCII DEVICE CONTROL #4
   21      00FF        RUB    EQU    $FF              ASCII RUBOUT CHARACTER
   22                  *
   23                  *DEFINITION OF CONSTANTS
   24                  *
   25      0001        LBYT   EQU    $1               DISPLACEMENT TO LOWER BYTE OF 2-BYTE VALUE
   26      0100        HBYT   EQU    $100             DIVISOR TO GENERATE SINGLE UPPER BYTE OF 2-BYTE VALUE
   27                  *
   28      0082        SYSSZ  EQU    130              EDOS IS PERMANENTLY ALLOCATED 130 SECTORS (SYSTEM AREA)
