   37      E824        EDITR  EQU    $E824            EDOS ROM LOAD A PROGRAM, START IT @ 20 HEX
   38      EA03        XUS    EQU    $EA03            EDOS ROM TRANSMIT UNIT/SECTOR(TRANSLATED) TO DISK
   39      EA22        XUSP   EQU    $EA22            EDOS ROM TRANSMIT UNIT/ PHYSICAL SECTOR TO DISK
   40      EA2B        SEEK   EQU    $EA2B            EDOS ROM SEEK SELECTED UNIT TO TRACK IN A
   41      EA38        RFLAG  EQU    $EA38            EDOS ROM RESET ERROR FLAG
